        },
        {
          "text": "Jakobo wakavwiila Farao kuti, Myaka yakweendeenda kwangu ili mwanda amakumi otatwe. Mazuba aamyaka yabuumi bwangu mace buyo, alimwi mabi, taana kweelana amazuba aamyaka yabuumi bwabamataata kuciindi cakweendeenda kwabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.9",
