        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela Josefa wakakazika wisi abakulana bakwe, wabapa civubilo munyika ya-Egepita, munyika imbotu, munyika ya-Ramese, mbubonya mbwaakalailila Farao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
