          "text": "Lino kwakabulika zilyo munyika yoonse, nkaambo ipamba lyakakomena loko, Nyika ya-Egepita anyika ya-Kanana yoonse zyakawizuka nkaambo kapamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
