        },
        {
          "text": "Lino Jakobo wakakala munyika ya-Egepita myaka iili ikumi amusanu aibili. Mazuba oonse aa-Jakobo, nkokuti myaka yoonse yabuumi bwakwe, akasika kumyaka iili mwanda amakumi one amusanu aibili. ",
