        {
          "text": "Elyo ciindi cakufwa kwa-Israyeli nicakasika kufwaafwi, wakaita mwanaakwe Josefa, wamwaambila kuti, Na ncobeni ndijene luzyalo mumeso aako, bika ijanza lyako kunsi lyacibelo cangu, undicitile caluzyalo acakusyomeka, Utandizikili mucisi ca-Egepita pe. ",
